Font Awesome 7.3.1 (Free)

The icon SVGs in this project are not bundled here. All Font Awesome icons
are inlined directly into the HTML files as `<svg>` elements with paths
copied from Font Awesome's `solid/`, `regular/`, and `brands/` SVG sets.
There is no `svg-with-js/` subdirectory and no `all.min.css`.

The CDN-loaded Font Awesome CSS was removed in v13.2 to eliminate the
`cdnjs.cloudflare.com` external-origin dependency. Each `<svg>` element
carries its own FA attribution comment header, and the project's Credits
modal (hamburger menu) lists the library version and CC BY 4.0 license.

Files in this directory:
- `favicon.svg`    Markdown brand icon (FA `brands/markdown.svg`, 7.3.1)
- `LICENSE`        Font Awesome Free 7.3.1 license (Icons CC BY 4.0, Fonts SIL OFL 1.1, Code MIT)
- `README`         This file

For user-facing attribution, see the Credits modal in the hamburger menu.
For the full upstream license text, see `LICENSE` in this directory.

Source: https://github.com/FortAwesome/Font-Awesome/tree/7.3.1